WEBVTT

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.860
We will land in Maiami 
International Airport shortly.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.480
Congratulations for the successful 
negotiations, Chairwoman.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:38.620
Thank you.  Our plan has 
taken another step forward.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:52.460
Reiji and my plan is to spread LDS's control worldwide so 
that we can develop many highly skilled and strong duelists.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:57.480
This successful acquisition has greatly 
pleased the company president.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.200
However...

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:00.770
However?

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:07.040
I didn't contact you because I didn't 
want to disturb your negotiations.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:11.600
Chairwoman, there were several incidents 
that concerned us while you were away.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:13.370
Incidents?

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:20.210
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:28.070
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:32.300
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:51.080
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.490
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.230
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:07.800
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:10.000
Impulse  Got it got it

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.210
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:25.970
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:32.890
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:36.830
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:40.230
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:50.510
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:53.850
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:03.960
You Show School in Danger!!  LDS Invades

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:08.170
Welcome back, Mother.

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:20.460
Reiji, there's a new summoning method 
that's not Fusion, Synchro or Xyz?

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:24.540
Yes, Mother.

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:35.620
It suddenly appeared about a month ago.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:44.540
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:56.080
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:59.060
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:02.020
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.020
Pendulum Summon!

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:07.500
Come out, my monsters!

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:19.780
We've detected a high level summoning 
signal at the city's seafront district!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.070
Analyze it immediately!

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:23.280
Here are the results of the analysis!

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:27.580
The summoning method is... Pendulum!

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:29.780
Pendulum Summon?

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:37.920
By using two special Pendulum Cards, you can summon 
many high Level monsters simultaneously without tributing.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:40.260
This was never possible before.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:45.180
Is this all due to that certain individual?

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.820
We are currently investigating the cause.

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:58.620
But in regards to Pendulum Summoning itself, we've 
gathered and analyzed the data, so we mostly have the full picture.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:01.700
Impressive as always, Reiji.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:05.740
The duelist who used it first is the issue.

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.860
His name is Yuya Sakaki.

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:14.060
He's a 14 year-old boy who attends 
this city's You Show Duel School.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.300
His class is Junior Youth.

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:21.340
His record this year is 
46 matches with 26 wins.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:24.980
His win percentage is less than 60%.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.980
He's nothing special.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:33.220
Someone in Junior Youth created 
a new summoning method?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.140
He is Yusyo Sakaki's son.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.780
Yusyo Sakaki!

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:46.860
After vanishing three years ago, has Yusyo 
Sakaki teamed up with our enemy and using his son?

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:51.380
I can't deny that possibility, 
but it may also be the opposite.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:52.500
Opposite?

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:59.300
A hoodlum assaulted Mr. 
Sawatari's son last night.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:05.100
The culprit was a duelist 
who used Xyz Summon.

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.850
It was Yuya Sakaki!

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:11.660
I saw his face with my own eyes!

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:14.380
There's no mistake!

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:16.120
Xyz Summon!

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:20.360
Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.980
He treated me like a fool!

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:30.660
Sawatari is hitting with his right arm.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.900
Don't say anything.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:33.660
You saw him too, right?

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.940
It was definitely Yuya Sakaki, right?

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:39.780
Of course.  Right?

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:44.700
Well, it was a bit dark...  But 
Yuzu Hiiragi said the same thing.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:48.900
Of course it was him.  Sawatari wouldn't lie.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:51.820
Exactly!

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:59.000
A noble city councilor's son would never lie!

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:08.100
There's a chance that someone who doesn't 
want me to enter the mayoral race is the culprit!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:17.540
I will pursue this issue and demand 
that Yuya Sakaki show up as a witness!

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:14.100
Sawatari's injuries are fake, right?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.540
Yeah.  I can't believe 
he doesn't realize that.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.660
All right!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.420
Shingo!

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:24.340
Papa will get your revenge!

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:26.110
Thank you, Papa!

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:30.020
Now now, don't get so worked up.

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:32.500
Chariman Akaba!

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:34.420
When did you return?

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:39.700
I just returned, and I heard 
about what happened to Shingo.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:42.660
I see.  Thank you.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.340
Of course.

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:48.500
Mr. Sawatari, you're the one who'll be 
carrying the burden of running Maiami City.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:54.550
When I heard that a hoodlum assaulted 
your son, I couldn't stay silent.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:59.260
Exactly!  I'll contact the 
Police Chief immediately.

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.860
You must not.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.860
This is an important time leading 
up to the mayoral election.

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:09.300
If you cause an uproar, you'll 
have new problems to deal with.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.020
But...

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:13.260
Please leave it to me.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.570
To you, Chairwoman?

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:16.180
Yes.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:22.280
I'll give you a result 
that you'll be happy with.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:27.260
Today's lesson is about dueling's 
various summoning methods.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:29.380
First is Normal Summon.

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:35.980
This is the most basic summoning method where you take a monster 
from your hand and place it faceup in attack position on the field.

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:38.420
Next is Tribute Summon.

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:40.500
Tatsuya, can you explain it?

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.820
Yes.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:53.100
Tribute Summon lets me summon from my hand, but if I'm summoning 
a Level 5 or 6 monster, I have to tribute one monster on my field.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:58.300
If it's Level 7-or-above, I 
must tribute two monsters.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.520
That's right.  Good.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:02.660
You've been studying.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:06.460
This lecture is boring.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.700
I already know this.

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:13.820
I Fusion Summon with vanilla 
ice cream and custard pudding!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:17.420
I will eat this sweet Vanilla Prince!

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:20.540
Delicious!

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:22.740
Hey, that's bad.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:25.060
It's not bad.  It's delicious.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.650
Yuya, want to eat too?

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:28.580
That's not what I meant!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:32.740
If you eat during class, 
Yuzu's fan is going to...

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:39.380
...not strike you?

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:43.700
She's been acting weird since yesterday.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:47.970
That wasn't Yuya?

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.640
What was that about?

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:54.180
Next is Fusion Summon.

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:56.380
Let's have Sora explain it.

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:58.540
Its donut effect activates!

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:01.420
Vanilla Prince has powered up even more!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:06.820
No eating during class, Sora!

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:09.380
Dad!  Xyz!

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.590
Xyz?

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:17.180
We've never taught Xyz Summon here, right?

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:19.220
Of course not.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.460
I can't teach what I've never done.

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:25.400
Even LDS has only started 
teaching it recently.

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:28.370
Why are you suddenly bringing up Xyz?

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.060
No reason.

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:40.620
What?

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:43.780
Nothing.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:53.260
Yeah, there's no way Yuya could use Xyz.

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:54.940
However...

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.300
A surprise attack?

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:00.640
There's no way Yuya would 
do something so underhanded!

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.580
Gongenzaka?

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.620
What's the commotion?

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.380
Headmaster!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:19.950
The man Gongenzaka was running to strengthen his legs when 
he noticed three suspicious men peeking into You Show School.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:25.550
When I questioned them, they said 
Yuya attacked them yesterday!

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:26.620
Attack them?

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:27.640
Me?

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.670
That's right!  Don't say you forgot!

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:33.370
We saw it with our own eyes!

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:36.970
There are four... actually, five witnesses!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:38.180
Five?

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:42.350
Sawatari, us... and her!

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:51.020
Right, Yuzu Hiiragi?

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:53.450
Is that true, Yuzu?

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:54.840
You saw it too?

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.970
Saw what?

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:59.370
The criminal's face!

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:05.370
The face of Yuya Sakaki attacking the 
next mayor's son Shingo Sawatari!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.680
Stop lying!

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:10.390
There's no way Yuya would do that!

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:12.840
Sawatari was the one who 
tried to attack Yuya!

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:16.620
Yuzu dueled him because 
she wanted to stop him!

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:18.080
Wait a second!

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:20.720
Yuya didn't duel, but Yuzu did?

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:21.550
That's right!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.700
And her opponent was...

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:23.860
Sawatari!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.370
That means...

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:27.460
Yuzu was the one who attacked them?

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:28.530
Wrong!

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:32.390
Like I said, it was Yuya Sakaki.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.880
He's the one who assaulted Sawatari!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:39.240
Poor Sawatari.  He's hurt so 
badly that's he's hospitalized.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:40.220
Hospitalized?

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:41.590
Oh no!

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:44.510
There's a chance that he might not live.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.900
Delicious!

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:52.440
If anything happens to Sawatari, 
how will you take responsibility?

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:55.060
Responsibility?  I...

00:12:56.930 --> 00:13:00.130
Say something, Yuzu!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:01.860
You saw everything, right?

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.900
I did, but...

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:12.080
That wasn't Yuya?

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:15.820
Are you accusing me too, Yuzu??

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:16.910
I...

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:28.750
If anything happens to Sawatari, the 
police will definitely arrest you.

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:30.790
Police?

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:37.500
Start from the beginning 
and explain what happened!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:43.460
I'll explain.

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:46.300
You're LDS's...

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.770
Yes.  I am the Chairwoman.

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:52.530
My name is Himika Akaba.

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:58.820
Well done.

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:00.820
That was excellent acting.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:05.100
Everything they said was the truth.

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:17.990
LDS student Shingo Sawatari was assaulted, and he 
testified that the culprit was You Show School's Yuya Sakaki.

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:22.840
Well, Yuya?

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.300
Did you really do that?

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.770
No, I didn't!

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:28.130
There's no way I would do that!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:33.280
The man Gongenzaka believes 
in his friend Yuya!

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:34.720
Everyone also, right?

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.620
Of course!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.690
What about you, Yuzu?

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.370
Yuya!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.970
That really wasn't you?

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:02.970
I don't know what you saw, but 
I wouldn't assault Sawatari!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:08.170
Okay.  I also believe you, Yuya.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.370
Oh my, such solidarity.

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:15.460
This means it's unlikely 
that you'll hand Yuya over.

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:19.870
But I can't back down either.

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:24.300
LDS is the #1 school in the industry.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:30.480
If a rumor that one of my students lost a 
duel spreads, that would deal us a heavy blow.

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:33.370
Like we said, it wasn't Yuya!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.730
That no longer matters!

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:41.190
The problem is that you tarnished LDS's name!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:48.090
In order to erase this dishonor, my 
students must battle you and win!

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:50.930
Compete in a duel?

00:15:55.770 --> 00:16:00.390
If your side wins, we will forget 
about the Sawatari issue.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:09.280
But if we win, Leo Duel School 
will take over You Show School.

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.950
What?

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:11.950
No way!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:17.100
It's not enough to clear your name?  
You also want to take You Show School?

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:24.530
Chairwoman Akaba, I heard that you're 
buying many duel schools around the world.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:28.790
You've now also targeted You Show School?

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:34.620
Maybe you planned the surprise attack!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:39.730
Definitely not!  But it's true that 
I'm using it as an opportunity.

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:49.020
Along with Fusion, Synchro and Xyz, it's 
LDS's chance to have Pendulum as its fourth pillar.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:55.860
Don't you think it's a waste for you to 
monopolize such a treasure, Headmaster Hiiragi?

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:08.960
LDS can use Leo Corporation's technological prowess to turn 
Pendulum Summoning into a curriculum and teach it to many students.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:15.380
Because there are many duelists who 
adore Yuya and want to use Pendulum.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.950
That's the same with you, right?

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:23.350
But you can't Pendulum Summon 
without Yuya's Pendulum Cards.

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:28.550
That can be solved with 
Leo Corporation's power.

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:32.680
That's why we have to become one.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:40.620
And if we become one, I can investigate 
Yuya Sakaki more thoroughly.

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:46.880
Is he my and Reiji's enemy, or...

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:51.050
A duel isn't a tool for fighting.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:57.820
But I don't want anyone else to take 
You Show School or Pendulum Summoning!

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:02.950
My dad built You Show School 
to teach entertainment dueling.

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:11.070
I can't let someone who uses money and power to take over 
a dueling school that teaches how to entertain the masses!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.150
Well said, Yuya!

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:19.350
The man Gongenzaka wholeheartedly agrees!

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:23.480
In order to protect You Show School, 
I'll fight alongside my friend!

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:26.480
But you're not a member of our school.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:33.350
If the schools are going to battle, 
then it should be Yuya, Yuzu and me.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:37.620
I always wanted to battle an LDS duelist.

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:41.880
To banish the man Gongenzaka!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:44.220
How inexcusable!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:48.340
It seems the students have made a decision.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.580
I also made my decision.

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.080
You Show School...

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:55.750
...you can't have it!

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:01.480
Then let's begin.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:08.950
Three versus three.

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:13.250
The first to two victories is the winner.

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.120
Who's dueling first?

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:17.220
Me!

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:18.640
No, it's me!

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:28.250
Of course.  The other two seem unreliable, so if 
you must start with a win, there's no other choice-

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.380
Whatever, old lady!

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:33.050
You don't know how strong I am!

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:34.550
Leave it be!

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:39.780
But you shouldn't think 
that you'll win easily.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:44.440
Yuya, they're all Junior 
Youth Class, like you.

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:48.100
But they're the aces in 
each of LDS's courses.

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:51.770
The one who will face Yuya is...

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:56.370
LDS's Xyz Course student Hokuto Shijima!

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:58.070
Xyz?

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:01.470
There he is!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:03.570
LDS's Hokuto Shijima!

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:08.320
His record this year is 58 matches, 53 wins?

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:10.720
His win rate is above 90%!

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:15.170
He easily met the requirements to 
enter the Junior Youth Championship!

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:18.870
He's one of this year's favorites 
to win the championship!

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:24.870
Even if he's an ace or a tournament 
favorite, there's no need to fear.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:27.770
Show him your power, Yuya!

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:30.520
Get fired up!  Let your blood boil!

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:31.920
Yeah!

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:50.870
My students can deal with any situation, 
so choose whatever you like.

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:54.870
Deal with any situation?

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:59.920
Then how about this!  Action Field on!

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:05.040
I activate the Field Spell Cosmic Sanctuary!

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:10.920
Gain the power of the stars and battle, Yuya!

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:22.620
He chose a field where I'm an expert.

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:24.120
What?

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:28.220
Since his name is Hokuto aka Big Dipper, 
you could have easily figured that out.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:34.170
I promise to win this duel!

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:41.280
I'll win and protect You Show 
School and my father's dueling!

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:45.520
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:48.520
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:50.520
...to move around the field!

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:55.190
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:56.930
Action!

00:21:56.930 --> 00:21:58.220
Duel!

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:18.910
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:28.390
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.280 --> 00:22:40.400
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:45.640
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:51.080
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:56.340
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.540 --> 00:23:01.940
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:06.360
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:12.330
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:17.740
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:23.040
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:32.380
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:40.630
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:50.220
Light of the stars, shake 
the earth and descend!

00:23:50.220 --> 00:23:53.180
Rank 5 Constellar Pleiades!

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:55.450
This is Xyz!

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:56.970
I've never seen it before!

00:23:56.970 --> 00:24:00.170
I hate to admit it, but it gives me shivers!

00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:03.870
Yuya, it's boring if you don't 
do more entertaining things!

00:24:03.870 --> 00:24:05.860
I don't have time for entertainment!

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:11.920
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Judgment of the Stars
Xyz User Hokuto Shijima

00:24:11.920 --> 00:24:14.270
The fun is only getting started!
